and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,P,Q)\\land\\rho(1_P)=1_Q\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p,p&#39;\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in R_P\\to\\langle\\rho(p),\\rho(p&#39;)\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;(\\langle q,\\rho(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R_P\\land\\langle\\rho(r),q\\rangle\\in R_Q)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,P,Q)\\land\\rho(1_P)=1_Q\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p,p&#39;\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p&#39;\\rangle\\in R_P\\to\\langle\\rho(p),\\rho(p&#39;)\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;(\\langle q,\\rho(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R_P\\land\\langle\\rho(r),q\\rangle\\in R_Q)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S(\\rho,P,Q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R_P,1_P,R_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S(\\rho,P,Q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R_P,1_P,R_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing orders and greatest conditions are explicit; the old three-argument interface is retained as an existential projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,R_P,1_P)","display":false},{"tex":"(Q,R_Q,1_Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(Q,R_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,P,Q)\\land\\rho(1_P)=1_Q\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall p,p'\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p'\\rangle\\in R_P\\to\\langle\\rho(p),\\rho(p')\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;(\\langle q,\\rho(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R_P\\land\\langle\\rho(r),q\\rangle\\in R_Q)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ReductionMap}_S(\\rho,P,Q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R_P,1_P,R_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ReductionMapStructure}_S(\\rho,P,R_P,1_P,Q,R_Q,1_Q)","display":true}],"bytes":1826,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2055","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing12-reduction-map.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-reduction-map]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["b5833df5ef175153","36d7463d215be751"]}